{
  "_readme": [
    "Single source of truth for every translated string in Earth Around.",
    "",
    "Keys are the ENGLISH SOURCE STRING, because SwiftUI's Text(\"literal\") uses the literal as its",
    "lookup key — so the English column must match the code exactly, character for character.",
    "",
    "gen_xcstrings.py turns this into one Localizable.xcstrings per target. It has to be per target:",
    "DesignShared/ and SpaceWeatherWidget/ are compiled SOURCE-LEVEL into several targets, so each",
    "process resolves against its own Bundle.main. Generating them from this one file is what stops",
    "the same sentence drifting between the app, the widget and the watch.",
    "",
    "Do not translate: Earth Around, NOAA SWPC, GFZ Potsdam, Kp, Hp30, ap/Ap, F10.7, Bz, Bt, units,",
    "flare class codes (M3.2), scale codes (G1/R2/S3), Bartels symbols (5+).",
    "",
    "Locales: en (base) + uk de fr es it pt-BR nl sv nb da fi pl cs tr ja ko zh-Hans zh-Hant.",
    "No ru, deliberately."
  ],
